[options]
[A.]
                                                <h2>Hades Altar<a href="#mission24">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>

                                        ~[Ialtar.89]
<br>
                                                        ~1~yNO WAY OUT!~.<br>
<br>
<i>"Do not fear Death! For if you do, your soul will taunt you forever.
Just lay back on the altar and close your eyes. Say your prayers to your
God if you wish. for even he can't save you now. Your soul is mine!"
<i>"There is nothing here my failing Apprentice but ~[IbombExplodeLarge.1]~kDEATH~[IbombExplodeLarge.1]<i>."
<p>
"Fear not for it will be over soon."~.
<p>
After your last mission the {sw_god5} was furious.<br>
Yet he has a tingling up his immortal spine. For he is getting another soul.
Not just any soul, but the soul of a Nimbus Priest. YOURS!! HAHAHA!<br>
<p>

            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                        <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                 <a href="cmd:Tell,cantleave">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>                         <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Onward!</a>                      <a href="cmd:Tell,cantleave">Leave quickly!</a>
<$PlaySound,PriestStruggleFade03.wav>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,PriestStruggleFade01.wav

$Button= ,Tell,A.

[cantleave]
Yeah, sure! Like you think the {sw_god5} is gonna let you walk right outta here?
I don't think so! You gotta pay your dues....
$Button=OK OK. Continue then,DoNothing,0

[@2]
<$MoveDialog,tr>
~I"What the heck?"~., you think to yourself. ~I"What can I do with only 200 storm Crystals.
I don't even have enough for a workshop!"
$Button=OH OH,DoNothing,0

[@10]
<$ViewSpot,(72x67)>
<$MoveDialog,tr>
Hmm... Looks like hell is very busy today. Lots of souls need sacrificing. There's a few billion
souls in front of you....
<p>
{sw_god5} has pulled some strings down here, however, and he's moved you up a couple of billion
spots in the line. He assures you that you'll be next... 
$Button=Gee thanks (I think!),DoNothing,0


[@30]
Wow, you never realized how busy {sw_hades} was! You have to wait for your turn
to be sacrificed! (This is one of Hell's torments (hehe)
$Button=Hurry it up, will ya! I only have eternity!,DoNothing,0

[@60]
The {sw_god5} pretends to whine....
<p>
<i>"So many souls to sacrifice, so little time...."</i>
<p>
$Button=This Fury is cruel!,DoNothing,0

[@110]
You brazenly speak up:
~I"Uhh.... {sw_god5}~I, can you hurry it up some? I've been waiting to
be sacrificed for an eternity, it seems...."
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[@115]
The {sw_god5} laughs long and hard....
<p>
<i>"Ahh, young apprentice. So eager to encounter ~[IbombExplodeLarge.1]~kDEATH
~[IbombExplodeLarge.1]<i>? You will wait your turn</i>
$Button=SOMEONE GET ME OUTTA HERE!,DoNothing,0



[ai1TempleHalfDead]
The {sw_god5} cackles with glee.
<i>"Observe how I am totally destroying all your hopes for saving yourself!"
<p>
"But I am not totally without pity.. hehe... here's some storm crystals for ya!"
<p>
"What's that, not enough? Sorry, I'm fresh out of storm crystals... hehe! Mebbe later I'll give you
more...."
<p>
"Now, if you'll excuse me, I have a sacrifice to perform..."

<$Changemoney,500>
$Button=Hoo boy!,DoNothing,0

[ai1TempleDead]
The {sw_god5} cackles with glee.
<i>"Observe how I am totally destroying all your hopes for saving yourself!"
<p>
"But I am not totally without pity.. hehe... here's some stormpower for ya!
You may build yourself another temple and a workshop...."
<$Changemoney,6000>
$Button=Hoo boy!,DoNothing,0

[ai1PriestCaptured]
You whine and say it's not fair! You didn't have a chance!
<p>
The {sw_god5} erupts in insane cackling
<p>
<i>"HAWHAWHAW! Of course it wasn't fair! I told you, your soul is mine now.
I'm just having some fun before I sacrifice you..."
<p>
"But I think you're right, it wasn't fair. You didn't have enough Storm Crystals.
Here, take some now! HEHEHE!"</i>
<$Changemoney,100000>
$Button=ENOUGH!,DoNothing,0



[Failed]
                   <h2>Finally, you have been sacrificed!</h2>
<p>
                                     ~[Ialtar.7]
<br>
  At last your soul has been released! However, {sw_hades}<br>
           now has it, and you will forever be tormented in<br>
                   THE BOWELS OF ~r~B~[Ipriest.103]~[IsunFlyerBomb.0]HELL~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]~[Ipriest.133]~.!
<p>
           Unless, of course, you would like to try again?
